  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.'
  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "- Appears on reels 2, 3, 4 and \n  5 and substitutes for all \n  symbols
      except            ."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "- 3 Bonus Symbols on reels 1,\n  3 and 5 during both Base and\n  Free
      Games triggers Spicy \n  Wheel Bonus."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "- 3 Bonus Symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers <b><color=#fff000>Spicy
      Wheel Bonus</color></b>.\n- Spicy Wheel contains 18 wedges and either Coin Prize
      or Free Games can be\n  obtained from each wedge. \n- Each time the Spicy Wheel
      stops on a wedge with Coin Prize, this wedge turns into\n  Free Games wedge
      and the other non-Free Games wedges upgrade their values.\n- Player spins the
      Spicy Wheel until winning Free Games.\n- Once Spicy Wheel Bonus ends, Red Hot
      Free Games is triggered."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '- Red Hot Free Games is triggered at the end of Spicy Wheel Bonus.

      - During Red Hot Free Games, each              becomes             .'
